# Cloudflare Pages response headers for every page and file.
# Security headers added 2026-11-27:
#   X-Frame-Options / frame-ancestors: no other site can show dankcharts.fm
#     inside a hidden frame and trick people into clicking things.
#   nosniff: the browser never treats an uploaded/proxied file as a script.
#   Referrer-Policy: other sites only see "dankcharts.fm", never the full
#     address (YouTube still gets the origin it needs to play embeds).
#   Permissions-Policy: the site never uses camera, microphone, location or
#     payments, so nothing on it (even a bad script) can ask for them.
#   object-src / base-uri: blocks two old tricks for loading foreign code.
# A full script CSP isn't set: the pages use many inline onclick handlers, so
# it would need 'unsafe-inline' and protect little. COOP stays for Google sign-in popups.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
